<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Fairwood shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Fairwood shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of fast food chain operator Fairwood Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
